---
// Page-wide animated background built from the poster's design assets
// (Google Drive > Item designs). It stays fixed while the content scrolls
// over it, so the whole page shares one seamless background.
// The pulse wave is one seamless strip that flows endlessly across the screen.
---

<div class="fx fx-page" aria-hidden="true">
  <img src="/images/fx/nebula.webp" alt="" class="fx-nebula fx-nebula-a" width="600" height="478" decoding="async" />
  <img src="/images/fx/nebula.webp" alt="" class="fx-nebula fx-nebula-b" width="600" height="478" decoding="async" />
  <div class="fx-wave fx-wave-a"></div>
</div>
